        "202250010": {
          "id": 202250010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1502,
          "text": "Whether gaming or drawing prizes, be mindful that you aren't sitting with your back to sharp objects or doors and windows, as those positions accumulate negative energy and leak wealth",
          "next": [
            202250011
          ]
        },
        "202250011": {
          "id": 202250011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1502,
          "text": "Load up on nine-squared grid hotpot, eggplants, pears, and tomatoes. The more you eat, the luckier you'll get",
          "next": [
            202250012
          ]
        },
        "202250012": {
          "id": 202250012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1502,
          "text": "Plus, lucky number, lucky time, and lucky object... They can't go wrong if you keep your eyes peeled",
          "next": [
            202250013
          ]
        },
        "202250013": {
          "id": 202250013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1502,
          "text": "Oh, and here's an easy-to-miss tip: Pay extra attention to items around you that share a sound with the word \"lose\" or \"slip,\" such as things like a \"goose\" or a \"noose,\" or perhaps something \"loose\" or \"missed\"",
          "next": [
            202250014
          ]
        },
        "202250014": {
          "id": 202250014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1502,
          "text": "I once had a card buddy who was losing five games straight. In a desperate thirst, he grabbed a glass of ReBeat Juice, and he ended up setting a personal record of fifty consecutive losses~",
          "next": [
            202250015,
            202250018
          ]
        },
        "202250015": {
          "id": 202250015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "I'll keep it in mind",
